  "rationale": {
    "zh-CN": "胆囊板剥离后出现第三根进入胆囊的结构；关键安全视野要求它也游离可见，并在离断前可靠夹闭。只处理两根结构即离断属于未真正达到安全视野的不可逆操作，完成胆囊床时会撕断后支出血。",
    "en": "Taking the gallbladder off the cystic plate shows a third structure entering it; the critical view needs it free and seen, and it must be clipped before division. Dividing only two is an irreversible step without a true view, and completing the bed tears the posterior branch."
  }
